    professionals: ['CPA / tax adviser (debt characterisation, §7872, §163(j))', 'Corporate attorney (documentation, authorisations)', 'Bookkeeper maintaining both ledgers consistently'],
    sourceAuthority: ['IRC §61(a)(11) — income from discharge of indebtedness', 'IRC §7872 — below-market loans', 'IRC §483 and §1274 — imputed interest and original issue discount on deferred payments', 'IRC §482 — allocation of income among controlled taxpayers', 'IRC §163(j) — business interest limitation', 'IRC §385 — debt vs equity', 'Case law on bona fide debt factors (e.g., Dixie Dairies Corp. v. Commissioner, 74 T.C. 476 (1980))'],
