      'The gross estate still includes the full value of the assets under §2033. Estate tax applies above the basic exclusion amount (set at $15 million per person from 2026 by 2025 legislation, indexed). Many "buy, borrow, die" families are also running lifetime-transfer planning to manage that exposure.',
