    jurisdiction: 'US state trust law (varies widely; directed-trust and protector statutes in Delaware, South Dakota, Nevada, Wyoming, Tennessee, Alaska, New Hampshire); federal estate tax rules. DIFC and ADGM trust laws in the UAE expressly recognise protectors and reserved powers; Cook Islands and Nevis permit settlors to reserve significant powers.',
